<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<%- include('./../../common/header') %>

<head>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net" crossorigin>
  <!-- 전통 서체(명조·궁서 느낌) + UI용 Pretendard -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nanum+Myeongjo:wght@400;700;800&family=Gugi&family=Nanum+Brush+Script&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css">
  <style>
    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       자미두수 소개 랜딩 v2
       · 배경이 하나로 이어지는 연속형(딥네이비 우주 + 빛의 실)
       · 전통 서체(Nanum Myeongjo / Gugi)로 "오래 이어져 온" 감성
       · 호기심 훅 + 사회적 증거 중심 카피
       · 하단 고정 CTA 바(입력 폼은 별도 페이지로 분리)
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    :root {
      --zw-ink:    #ECE3D0;   /* 오래된 종이빛 본문 */
      --zw-ink-d:  #A7A28F;   /* 흐린 본문 */
      --zw-gold:   #C9A24B;   /* 은은한 금 */
      --zw-gold-l: #E6C77E;
      --zw-seal:   #B23A2E;   /* 인장(낙관) 붉은색 — 아주 소량 */
      --zw-glow:   #FFD79A;   /* 실의 빛 */
      --zw-bar-h:  86px;
    }

    .ziwei-lp * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body.ziwei-body { margin: 0; background: #05070E; }

    .ziwei-lp {
      position: relative;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--zw-ink);
      font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      line-height: 1.6;
      /* 배경이 끊기지 않도록: 페이지 전체를 하나의 긴 그라데이션이 관통 */
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg,
          #0A1024 0%,
          #0C1330 16%,
          #070C1E 34%,
          #05070E 50%,
          #0A1230 66%,
          #070B1C 82%,
          #05070E 100%);
      padding-bottom: calc(var(--zw-bar-h) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px) + 20px);
    }
    /* 고정 별빛 레이어 — 스크롤해도 계속 깔려서 '한 세계' 느낌 */
    .ziwei-lp::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(1.4px 1.4px at 12% 18%, rgba(255,255,255,0.55), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.2px 1.2px at 78% 12%, rgba(255,255,255,0.45), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 34% 42%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.6px 1.6px at 64% 66%, rgba(255,240,200,0.5), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1px 1px at 22% 78%, rgba(255,255,255,0.35), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.3px 1.3px at 88% 84%, rgba(255,255,255,0.4), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(1.1px 1.1px at 48% 92%, rgba(255,255,255,0.35), transparent 60%);
      opacity: 0.9;
    }
    .ziwei-lp > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    .ziwei-lp .wrap {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 26px;
    }

    /* ── 섹션: 카드/보더 없이 배경 위로 흐름 ── */
    .ziwei-lp .section {
      padding: 46px 0 46px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ziwei-lp .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'Gugi', 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5em;
      text-indent: 0.5em;
      color: var(--zw-gold);
      margin-bottom: 22px;
      opacity: 0.92;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .title {
      font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 52px);
      line-height: 1.28;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: #FBF6EA;
      margin: 0;
      word-break: keep-all;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    /* 키워드 강조: 형광펜 대신 '먹/금 획' 스며든 하이라이트 + 전통 서체 유지 */
    .ziwei-lp .title .em {
      position: relative;
      color: var(--zw-gold-l);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .title .em::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      left: -2px; right: -2px; bottom: 0.06em;
      height: 0.34em;
      z-index: -1;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(201,162,75,0.28) 0%, rgba(201,162,75,0.30) 100%);
      border-radius: 2px;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .title .brush {
      font-family: 'Gugi', 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
      color: var(--zw-gold-l);
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .subtitle {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: clamp(16px, 4.4vw, 20px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--zw-ink);
      word-break: keep-all;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .body {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: clamp(15px, 4vw, 18px);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--zw-ink-d);
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    /* 사회적 증거 배지(인장 느낌) */
    .ziwei-lp .proof {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 26px;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(178,58,46,0.10);
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.35);
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      color: var(--zw-gold-l);
    }
    .ziwei-lp .proof b { color: #F2E4C0; font-weight: 800; }
    .ziwei-lp .proof .seal {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--zw-seal); color: #fff; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700;
      font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif;
    }

    /* ── 빛의 실: 섹션과 섹션을 잇는 연결선 ── */
    .ziwei-lp .thread {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 92px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .thread::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; bottom: 0;
      width: 1.5px; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg,
        rgba(255,215,154,0) 0%, rgba(201,162,75,0.55) 26%,
        rgba(201,162,75,0.55) 74%, rgba(255,215,154,0) 100%);
    }
    .ziwei-lp .thread::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0;
      width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: var(--zw-glow);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px 3px rgba(255,210,120,0.75);
      animation: thread-drop 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes thread-drop {
      0%   { top: 4%;  opacity: 0; }
      18%  { opacity: 1; }
      82%  { opacity: 1; }
      100% { top: 90%; opacity: 0; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .ziwei-lp .thread::after { animation: none; opacity: 0.8; top: 46%; }
    }

    /* ── GIF 미디어: 테두리 없이 배경으로 스며듦(위/아래 페이드 마스크) ── */
    .ziwei-lp .media {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 34px auto 0;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 11;
      overflow: hidden;
      -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 16%, #000 84%, transparent 100%);
              mask-image: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, #000 16%, #000 84%, transparent 100%);
    }
    .ziwei-lp .media--tall { aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; }
    .ziwei-lp .media--wide { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
    .ziwei-lp .media > img {
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      width: 100%; height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover; display: block;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .media::before { /* 이미지 없을 때 은은한 성운 플레이스홀더 */
      content: attr(data-label);
      position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'Gugi', serif;
      font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-indent: 0.3em;
      color: rgba(201,162,75,0.4);
      background:
        radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 42%, rgba(58,74,140,0.35), transparent 70%),
        radial-gradient(40% 40% at 62% 60%, rgba(178,58,46,0.10), transparent 70%);
    }
    .ziwei-lp .media > img { z-index: 1; }

    /* ── 페이드 업(텍스트만) ── */
    .ziwei-lp .fade-up { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(26px); transition: opacity 0.75s ease, transform 0.75s ease; }
    .ziwei-lp .fade-up.in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .ziwei-lp .fade-up { opacity: 1; transform: none; transition: none; } }

    /* ══════ HERO ══════ */
    .ziwei-lp .hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100svh;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 92px 26px 40px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .hero__media { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; z-index: 0; }
    .ziwei-lp .hero::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5,7,14,0.55) 0%, rgba(5,7,14,0.15) 40%, rgba(5,7,14,0.75) 82%, #05070E 100%);
    }
    .ziwei-lp .hero__inner { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 720px; }
    .ziwei-lp .hero .eyebrow { font-size: 17px; }
    .ziwei-lp .hero .title { font-size: clamp(32px, 8.6vw, 56px); line-height: 1.3; }
    .ziwei-lp .hero__cue {
      position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 22px; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 2;
      width: 1.5px; height: 52px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(201,162,75,0.9));
    }
    .ziwei-lp .hero__cue::after {
      content: ""; position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--zw-glow);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px 3px rgba(255,210,120,0.75);
      animation: thread-drop 2.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    /* 상단 브랜드 바 */
    .ziwei-lp .topbar {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 3;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .topbar__back { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; color: #efe6d6; text-decoration: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.7); }
    .ziwei-lp .topbar__brand { font-family: 'Gugi', serif; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.4em; text-indent: 0.4em; color: var(--zw-gold); text-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.7); }

    /* ── 6개 정보 (Section 3): 박스 대신 먹판 느낌, 배경과 이어지게 ── */
    .ziwei-lp .cardgrid { margin-top: 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 12px; }
    .ziwei-lp .infocard {
      padding: 24px 14px; border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20,26,48,0.55), rgba(10,14,30,0.35));
      border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.16);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .ziwei-lp .infocard__ico { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1; color: var(--zw-gold); display: block; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .ziwei-lp .infocard__name { font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; color: #F6EFDE; }
    .ziwei-lp .infocard__desc { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--zw-ink-d); word-break: keep-all; }

    /* ── 2단 (Section 5 · 8) ── */
    .ziwei-lp .split { margin-top: 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 26px; text-align: left; align-items: center; }
    .ziwei-lp .split .media { margin-top: 0; }
    .ziwei-lp .split__text .title { text-align: left; }

    .ziwei-lp .checklist { margin: 22px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .ziwei-lp .checklist li {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 13px 0;
      font-size: 17px; color: var(--zw-ink);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.14);
    }
    .ziwei-lp .checklist li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .ziwei-lp .checklist .tick {
      flex: 0 0 24px; width: 24px; height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.5); color: var(--zw-gold-l); font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* ── 비교 (Section 8) ── */
    .ziwei-lp .compare { margin-top: 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; text-align: left; }
    .ziwei-lp .cmpcard { padding: 28px 22px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(12,17,36,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.16); }
    .ziwei-lp .cmpcard--gold { border-color: rgba(201,162,75,0.45); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30,24,12,0.5), rgba(12,17,36,0.5)); }
    .ziwei-lp .cmpcard__tag { font-family: 'Gugi', serif; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--zw-ink-d); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .ziwei-lp .cmpcard--gold .cmpcard__tag { color: var(--zw-gold-l); }
    .ziwei-lp .cmpcard__title { font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 800; color: #F6EFDE; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .ziwei-lp .cmpcard__desc { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--zw-ink-d); word-break: keep-all; }

    /* ── 후기 (Section 6) ── */
    .ziwei-lp .reviews { margin-top: 34px; }
    .ziwei-lp .review { height: auto; padding: 26px 22px; border-radius: 16px; background: rgba(12,17,36,0.55); border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.16); text-align: left; }
    .ziwei-lp .review__stars { color: var(--zw-gold-l); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .ziwei-lp .review__text { font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--zw-ink); word-break: keep-all; min-height: 90px; }
    .ziwei-lp .review__who { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--zw-ink-d); }
    .ziwei-lp .swiper { padding-bottom: 4px; }
    .ziwei-lp .swiper-slide { height: auto; }

    /* ── 흐름 (Section 9) ── */
    .ziwei-lp .flow { margin: 40px auto 0; max-width: 330px; }
    .ziwei-lp .flow__step { padding: 15px 18px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(12,17,36,0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.16); font-size: 17px; font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif; color: var(--zw-ink); }
    .ziwei-lp .flow__step.is-last { border-color: rgba(201,162,75,0.5); color: var(--zw-gold-l); background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30,24,12,0.6), rgba(12,17,36,0.5)); }
    .ziwei-lp .flow__arrow { height: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: rgba(201,162,75,0.55); font-size: 13px; }

    /* ── 마지막 클로징(폼 없음) ── */
    .ziwei-lp .closing { padding: 60px 0 40px; text-align: center; }
    .ziwei-lp .closing .title { font-size: clamp(30px, 8.4vw, 54px); }

    /* ══════ 하단 고정 CTA 바 ══════ */
    .zw-bar {
      position: fixed; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 90;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 16px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(6,9,18,0.4) 0%, rgba(6,9,18,0.92) 40%, #060912 100%);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(201,162,75,0.22);
    }
    .zw-bar__proof { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--zw-ink-d); font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif; }
    .zw-bar__proof .heart { color: var(--zw-seal); }
    .zw-bar__proof b { color: var(--zw-gold-l); font-weight: 800; }
    .zw-bar__btn {
      display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 480px;
      padding: 16px 0; border: none; border-radius: 13px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #E6C77E 0%, #C9A24B 55%, #A9832F 100%);
      color: #23180A; text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Nanum Myeongjo', serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      box-shadow: 0 -2px 24px rgba(201,162,75,0.18), 0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      transition: transform 0.12s;
    }
    .zw-bar__btn:active { transform: scale(0.99); }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .ziwei-lp .cardgrid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
      .ziwei-lp .split { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; }
      .ziwei-lp .split--rev .split__media { order: 2; }
      .ziwei-lp .compare { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="ziwei-body">
<div class="ziwei-lp">

  <!-- ══════ HERO ══════ -->
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="topbar">
      <a href="/saju" class="topbar__back" aria-label="뒤로">&#8592;</a>
      <span class="topbar__brand">紫微斗數</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media media" data-label="" style="mask:none;-webkit-mask:none;aspect-ratio:auto;margin:0;">
      <img src="/gif/hero.gif" alt="" onerror="this.remove()">
    </div>
    <div class="hero__inner">
      <span class="eyebrow fade-up">紫微斗數 · 자미두수</span>
      <h1 class="title fade-up">당신이 태어난 순간<br>하늘의 별은<br><span class="em">이미 자리를 정했습니다</span></h1>
      <p class="subtitle fade-up">그 별의 자리가 곧,<br>당신 삶의 지도입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="hero__cue" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </header>

  <!-- ══════ SECTION 2 · 왜 ══════ -->
  <div class="thread" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="title fade-up">도대체 왜<br><span class="brush">자미두수</span>에<br><span class="em">열광할까요?</span></h2>
      <div class="media media--wide" data-label="장면 · GIF"><img src="/gif/section2.gif" alt="" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <p class="body fade-up">사주가 삶의 큰 결을 본다면,<br>자미두수는 연애·재물·직업까지<br>삶의 영역을 하나하나 짚어 보여줍니다.</p>
      <span class="proof fade-up"><span class="seal">印</span> 지금까지 <b>18,482</b>명이 명반을 확인했습니다</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════ SECTION 3 · 무엇을 ══════ -->
  <div class="thread" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="title fade-up">자미두수는<br>당신의 무엇을<br><span class="em">비추는가</span></h2>
      <div class="media" data-label="명반 · GIF"><img src="/gif/section3.gif" alt="" onerror="this.remove()"></div>
      <div class="cardgrid">
        <div class="infocard fade-up"><span class="infocard__ico">◇</span><span class="infocard__name">성향</span><p class="infocard__desc">타고난 기질과 마음의 결</p></div>
        <div class="infocard fade-up"><span class="infocard__ico">緣</span><span class="infocard__name">연애</span><p class="infocard__desc">인연의 흐름과 관계의 온도</p></div>
        <div class="infocard fade-up"><span class="infocard__ico">職</span><span class="infocard__name">직업</span><p class="infocard__desc">잘 맞는 길과 일의 방향</p></div>
        <div class="infocard fade-up"><span class="infocard__ico">財</span><span class="infocard__name">재물</span><p class="infocard__desc">돈이 들고 나는 구조</p></div>
